---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Correction Request
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : student with an open case reports a wrong value
    pending --> approved : advisor approves (new correction row, same valid-from)
    pending --> rejected : advisor rejects with a note
    pending --> withdrawn : student withdraws
    approved --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    withdrawn --> [*]
